    "s7_site_t": `🌐 Project site`,
    "s7_final": `This policy may be updated when new features are added. Material changes will be noted in the extension's release notes on the Chrome Web Store listing. Continued use of YT Radar after a policy change constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.`,
